# TVs this Mac manages, one per line: <name> <ip>
# Copy this file to tvs.conf (git-ignored) and set your TV's fixed IP.
# Scripts use the first TV unless you pass a name, e.g. bin/check bedroom
# A TV that isn't a TCL names its own package lists as a third field, e.g.
# "sony" for lists/sony/.
living-room  192.168.1.50
